  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Access to Finance Rwanda phase II (ICF 25%) is a component of UK Support to Access to Finance Rwanda (AFR) Phase II Operations (2016-2020) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;873,821. It works in the following sector(s): Informal/semi-formal financial intermediaries, Financial policy and administrative management, Formal sector financial intermediaries, Education/training in banking and financial services, Monetary institutions.</narrative>
